<title>UK: Wheat carrier arrives under tow in Azores.</title>
<headline>Wheat carrier arrives under tow in Azores.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Panamana-flag bulker Mariner C., laden with 53,000 tonnes of wheat, arrived under tow at St. Michael's in the Azores, Lloyd's Shipping Intelligence Service said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The 65,085-dwt vessel has generator damage.</p>
